  "ingredients": [
    "2 medium potatoes, scrubbed",
    "4 tablespoons vegetable oil, divided",
    "0.5 teaspoon ground cumin",
    "0.5 teaspoon ground coriander",
    "0.5 teaspoon turmeric powder",
    "0.5 teaspoon chili powder",
    "0.5 teaspoon salt",
    "3 large eggs, beaten",
    "salt and pepper to taste"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Md5ez_c_ViQMyKsWNx0xsoNAnnc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/23913-Spicy-Potatoes-and-Scrambled-Eggs-ddmfs-step-1-149-58081f8cf69f4c97a6e040ccc943c9aa.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/23913/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Use a fork to pierce potato skins. Microwave potatoes on high until tender, 7 to 8 minutes. Let cool briefly, then peel and cut into small cubes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/MkHbYcvwr1io-CR2Itq3s3GNgIM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/23913-Spicy-Potatoes-and-Scrambled-Eggs-ddmfs-step-2-155-38817c5c327a43dbb40ba0522a39c8dc.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/23913/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat 2 tablespoons oil in a skillet over medium-high heat. Stir in cumin, coriander, turmeric, chili powder, and 1/2 teaspoon salt, then add potatoes. Cook, stirring occasionally, until crispy and golden brown, 5 to 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/8SIE0seR1xZ7nXjjLfaDj48OveM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/23913-Spicy-Potatoes-and-Scrambled-Eggs-ddmfs-step-4-161-87bf61040112456d857cf91b1c9d8b2d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/23913/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, heat 2 tablespoons oil in another skillet over medium-high heat. Pour eggs into the skillet; cook and stir until eggs are set, about 5 minutes. Season with salt and pepper and serve with potatoes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/tTl6Tn6eUlt2v7tiEAY_afmFyKc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/23913-Spicy-Potatoes-and-Scrambled-Eggs-ddmfs-step-7-165-30fb07fa0469464098d60af5cc786f8f.jpg"
      ],
